{"unit_id":"Blaczz__dsh-soundscape#feature-session-cues","repo":"Blaczz/dsh-soundscape","commit":"2970030e6931b377f5b2509a7057c177b1ce5529","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH Soundscape** 的功能「回合状态提示」：监听会话快照变化，在回合开始时播放敲击声，成功完成时播放铃声或庆祝音，出错或中断时播放低鸣；状态转换触发，无需手动操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/SessionListener.tsx:123-145","src/client/turn-feedback.ts:55-75"]}
